\vspace{0.22cm}
{\Large\bfseries\color{ChapterBlue} 全書一句話 \textperiodcentered\ The Whole Story in One Verse}

\vspace{0.30cm}
\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{ScriptureBg}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\centering\vspace{0.2cm}
\normalsize\color{CommentaryBrown}
你的家和你的國必在你面前永遠\textbf{\color{RoyalRed}堅立}；\\
你的國位也必\textbf{\color{RoyalRed}堅定}，直到永遠。\\[0.5em]
\footnotesize\itshape
And your house and your kingdom shall be made sure forever before me.\\
Your throne shall be \textbf{established} forever.\\[0.4em]
\small\color{ChapterBlue} 撒母耳記下 7:16 \textperiodcentered\ 2 Samuel 7:16
\vspace{0.2cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.35cm}
{\small\color{TextGray} 一句應許 \textperiodcentered\ 三個階段 \textperiodcentered\ 整段王國史\\
\textit{One promise \textperiodcentered\ three stages \textperiodcentered\ the whole kingdom story}}

\vspace{0.30cm}
{\small
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.3}
\begin{tabular}{@{}p{2.0cm}p{2.6cm}p{4.4cm}@{}}
\toprule
\textbf{階段} & \textbf{王} & \textbf{在全書的展開} \\
\midrule
人選的王 & 掃羅 & 撒上8-15章 —— 外貌合乎眾人，心卻沒有降服於神 \\
神揀選的王 & 大衛 & 撒上16章-撒下24章 —— 合神心意，卻仍需要一位更美的後裔 \\
應許的王 & 大衛的子孫 & 撒下7:12-16 —— 那位國位堅定直到永遠的，唯獨基督 \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
}

\vspace{0.4cm}
\textcolor{ScriptureGold}{\rule{2.5in}{0.7pt}}
\vspace{0.3cm}

{\bfseries\color{ChapterBlue} 讀經之鑰 \textperiodcentered\ How to Read This Book}

\vspace{0.18cm}
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\small\color{TextGray}
不是來讀一段王國興衰史，是來認出誰才是真正配作王的那一位。\\
掃羅的崩潰、大衛的跌倒，都不是終點——\\
每一頁都在把你的眼目，從人的王引向神所應許的王。\\[0.5em]
\textit{\footnotesize
You are not just reading a history of kings — you are learning to
recognize the One truly worthy of the throne.\\
Saul's collapse and David's failures are not the end of the story;
every page points beyond the human king to the promised King.}
\end{minipage}

\vfill
{\scriptsize\color{LightGray} PubHub 三書精讀系統 \textperiodcentered\ Soli Deo Gloria}

\vspace{0.3in}
