{\normalsize\bfseries\color{ChapterBlue} 關於本書 \;\; \footnotesize\scshape About This Book}

\vspace{0.2cm}
\noindent\begin{minipage}{4.7in}
\footnotesize\color{TextGray}
本書逐章研讀撒母耳記上下，整合黃長老查經教導、
John MacArthur 逐節解經、G. Campbell Morgan 屬靈組織分析，
並貫通摩西五經、詩篇與四福音書。
全書以撒母耳記上 16:7 為總綱：
「耶和華不像人看人，人是看外貌，耶和華是看內心。」\\[0.4em]
{\itshape
A chapter-by-chapter study of 1-2 Samuel, integrating Elder Wong's
teaching, John MacArthur's verse-by-verse exposition, and
G. Campbell Morgan's spiritual analysis — framed by 1 Samuel 16:7:
man looks on the outward appearance, but the LORD looks on the heart.}
\end{minipage}

\vspace{0.35cm}

